t(37, 400, """Between 1904 and 1908 the German emperor orders the extermination of the men, children and elderly of both sexes in Namibia in Africa, sparing only Namibia's young women! The result: 75% of the Namibian people departed this life!""")

t(37, 730, """Because of the occupation .. the Congo in 1960 had:
Only 16 educated people out of 14 million souls! Not 16 thousand. 16 persons!!

And the plunder of the world is still going on .. Very clean states in the north of the world: all the refinement and progress in them, the prosperity of their people's lives, their social security and fine care services, and the great industrial development — its cause is the plunder of at least 14 African states .. Their wealth is being plundered for free up to the moment these words are written! Luxurious and expensive products of every kind are made in those northern states; the raw material in them is plundered, not bought with money! Because the cost of the plundered raw material is zero, it was natural for innovators to work at ease and for money to be put into scientific research, as long as there are no exhausting expenses for buying raw materials.

In the forties the world began to think that Africa had been freed from what used to be called colonialism! The truth is that many states in sub-Saharan Africa are still in the forties of the last century! Their citizens grow poorer and the northern states grow in plunder! The silliest part of the story is when a European says to you: we are a clever and skilful nation and we eat our bread with honour, we built Europe by our own effort and worked seriously, so why are you Arabs lazy?!

The truth is that we are not lazy! We just do not plunder the world! That is all!""")

t(37, 1470, """The Italian Defence Minister: I cannot sleep!""")

t(38, 160, """The sign that Allah the Exalted has fashioned you for Himself is that you love with your mind, because your heart is wholly Allah's. So when that fashioning descends in you in truth and not in illusion, and you see in yourself what you were not used to — whether by degrees that life and time climb with striving, or by a casting of 'Be, and it is' without effort or striving! Then when you sense that your soul no longer feels with the feelings of the heart and has come to feel by the mind and through the mind (logic) only, know that your heart has been emptied completely of all the values of this world. You no longer love people with it, even your own dear child, your blood and your flesh; you no longer get angry at people with it, but have come to be angry with the mind (logic); you no longer grieve with it over the fortunes of this world, but have come to do all of that with your mind (with logic), not with your heart and human feelings. Only then will you feel that the scale of justice in your soul is finer than a hair, and that your values and standards have become straight, firm, steady, noble, wise, never swerving. Blessed on that day is every beloved one near you, for he will see from you all the values of beauty, justice and goodness; and woe on that day from you to everyone who deserves punishment!

These are my words for whoever would like to read his own soul and know the truth of what he has reached between himself and our Mighty Lord, sanctified be His names, magnified in the heavens and on earth, exalted in great exaltation.""")

h(38, 1400, """{And I fashioned you for Myself!}""")

