t(44, 1160, """The "Khayriyya" system .. The owner of "Khayriyya", live on air, imitates hashish smokers .. Exposing the truth about a deviant does not justify imitating him in a shameful and crude way while women are watching the broadcast .. Look at whom you take your religion from!!""")

t(44, 2415, """The owner of "Khayriyya" .. You will not find ignorance greater than what people have heard""")

h(45, 500, """The ignorant man's counsel to Muslims. The ignorant man says to Muslims: "Every harmful substance in food, you will eat it; your bodies will adapt to it"!!""")

t(45, 1185, """This is a slander by this ignorant man, the owner of "Khayriyya", against the Prophet ﷺ and his family, and a use of the sound, upright Prophetic method by way of misleading and deception! Yes, when the Prophet ﷺ was offered a food he liked he ate it, and if he did not like it he turned away from it; but the Prophet ﷺ was not being offered foul food containing harmful substances! The ignorant man says to Muslims: eat what you like, because the Prophet ﷺ did that!!""")

h(45, 1800, """The ignorant man's counsel to Muslims. The ignorant man says to Muslims: "When the Prophet liked a food he ate it; this is the standard a Muslim must follow"!!""")

t(45, 2495, """To correct the understanding in the mind of the owner of "Khayriyya": from Abu Hurayrah, may Allah be pleased with him: the Messenger of Allah ﷺ said: "Souls are troops gathered together; those that recognise one another unite, and those that do not recognise one another differ" (narrated by Muslim in his Sahih).
There is no conflict between this hadith and the hadith of the hypocrites' hatred of Imam Ali, peace be upon him. Did the hypocrites look at the face of""")

t(46, 155, """Imam Ali and hate him because he, peace be upon him, was not righteous? Far from it, never! So how then do we reconcile two hadiths established with sound chains?
As for "souls are troops gathered together": those whose owners' selves are good unite, and those whose owners' selves are foul also unite, because they are two kinds that unite either on soundness of selves or on foulness of selves. But if a soul whose owner's self is foul meets a soul whose owner's self is righteous, the two souls are estranged and recoil from each other, and so there is the inevitable enmity! This hadith explains the hadith of the hatred of the hypocrites and dajjals for Imam Ali, and by it is measured the hatred of every dajjal for every righteous person.""")

h(46, 950, """The ignorant man says: If I look at a person's face and do not feel at ease with him, I hate him! Imam Muslim narrated in his Sahih from Ali ibn Abi Talib, may Allah be pleased with him, that he said: “By Him who split the seed and created the soul, it is the covenant of the unlettered Prophet ﷺ to me: that none loves me but a believer, and none hates me but a hypocrite”""")

t(46, 1690, """O people, this is wrong and disastrous talk coming from the owner of "Khayriyya". O you who have diabetes, do not take from this ignorant man or you will ruin yourselves. Not everything you eat turns into sugar, ever. This is ignorance through which people with diabetes will be ruined, because it will keep them from eating many foods that are very safe for them, completely safe, and that do not turn into sugar inside their bodies; and great confusion will arise among the people who believe this ignorance .. Do not take from this ignorant man. This ignorant man will wreck the diet followed by type 2 diabetes patients, and the excellent dietary regime followed by those with insulin resistance and by those who wish to preserve their health!""")

h(46, 2300, """The ignorant man says to people: A trustworthy doctor whose religion I trust told me: Everything we eat turns into sugar, except water!!""")

t(47, 735, """Truly this is the decisive word that settles the matter of the owner of “Khayriyya”""")

h(47, 1200, """The ignorant man says: Whatever a person eats, his body will adapt!! He denies the fact that the body is affected by harmful foods!!""")

t(47, 1900, """Part of Allah the Almighty's withholding success from the owner of "Khayriyya" is that he forgot that in the live broadcast there is the physician, there is the veterinarian, there is the nutrition specialist, there is the agricultural engineer, and there is the ordinary follower who has read the specialists' research and educated himself! He forgets that when he speaks in ignorance, whether during the broadcast or after it, specialists will watch his episode!

He says that Allah the Exalted told us: eat everything in the world outside the well-known prohibitions in the verse! What matters is that we not be excessive!! That is, we walk in the forest, find a mushroom of the poisonous kind, and eat of it on condition that we are not excessive!! The poisonous mushroom in the forest is not mentioned among the prohibitions in the Book of Allah the Exalted: carrion, pork, blood, what is dedicated to other than Allah, the strangled, the beaten to death, the fallen, the gored, and what a wild beast has eaten. Apart from that the ignorant man tells people: eat everything other than these; what matters is do not be excessive!! Europe has banned foods proven to cause diseases, and California just yesterday banned E320. The people of knowledge firmly grounded in modern food sciences, whom Allah has taught and given insight, number hundreds among Arabic speakers today, not dozens; they warn against hundreds of modern processed and unprocessed foods, with a scientific alternative, and he forgets that we are the Ummah of "Read"!! So he spreads a disaster among people, so that their health is ruined more and more by the method of ignorance in which he is drowning!

These are sicknesses of the soul! So-and-so saw the prophet of Allah Jesus. How can he see him and I do not? So-and-so is a liar, he made the vision up from his own head! Diya, may Allah have mercy on him, said very important things that were very beneficial, and I spoke much about his mistakes, may Allah have mercy on him, ...""")

t(48, 140, """... and by every beneficial thing he said he deserved people's love and their prayers for him! People's love for a Muslim is a problem for this man who spreads ignorance among people!""")

h(48, 700, """The method of one of the dajjals: When I hate a person I will spend every effort to bring him down, even if I speak with an ignorance that makes me a laughing-stock among people!""")

t(48, 1425, """Charlatanry is not only what people see amid incense and the screams of the devil-possessed. The worst kind of charlatanry is for a man to speak and say "Allah said" and apply the words of Allah the Almighty out of their place, in a way that serves the corruption of his own soul. And among the greatest charlatanry is to take on the bearing of the Prophet ﷺ and his family while accusing this one of lying and that one of slander, disparaging this one and attacking that one; so the bearing is a bearing of charlatanry, not a true embodiment of the morals of the noble Prophethood.

The owner of "Khayriyya" is known far and near for his love of chatter and of spreading ignorance. Had he not spoken to the general public I would not have replied, because whoever is silent about the spreading of evil is a partner in the evil .. This dajjal, who thinks his gathering is a gathering of knowledge while it is a gathering of backbiting and aggression against everyone who does not please him, says that Diya is now with his Lord being called to account by Him!! What audacity is this against the King? By Allah, had you known the worth of the King, our Mighty Lord, even with a little knowledge, you would not have dared against the King. Do you speak in the name of the Compeller?!! Do you inform us what the Compeller, sanctified be His names, is doing now in His heaven?! And do you inform us of what is happening now to one of His servants whose soul has gone up to Him? How audacious you are! By Allah, you are either an ignoramus of severe ignorance or a reckless man who does not know where he is placing himself! What if Allah the Exalted has forgiven him! From where did you learn that Allah the Exalted is calling him to account now? May Allah confound ignorance once, and may Allah confound audacity a thousand thousand times.""")

h(48, 2300, """A dajjal among the dajjals of YouTube says about Diya: Allah is now calling him to account!! Glory be to Allah! And who told you that Allah the Exalted is calling him to account? Are you one of the witnesses?!""")

t(49, 785, """How easy acting is! The owner of "Khayriyya" preaches to people! Religion, religion .. Piety, piety .. O people .. Religion, religion""")

h(49, 1250, """Whoever accuses a Muslim of lying, his prayer has not restrained him from indecency and wrongdoing!!""")

t(49, 1985, """- A woman came to the Prophet ﷺ and said: "O Messenger of Allah, this son of mine: my belly was a vessel for him, my lap a shelter for him, and my breast a water-skin for him; and his father claims that he will take him away from me." He said: "You have more right to him as long as you do not marry."

Summary of the hadith scholar's ruling: Its narrators are trustworthy
Narrator: Abdullah ibn Amr | Hadith scholar: Al-Haythami | Source: Majma' al-Zawa'id | Page or number: 4/326
| Sourcing: Reported by Abu Dawud (2276) and Ahmad (6707), and the wording is his""")

h(50, 400, """The small child belongs to his mother, on condition that she does not marry after her divorce!""")

t(50, 1000, """A strong dominance by the other world is today's reality and not an illusion, in this time of ours and at a high pace, just as used to happen to people in the times of the Prophet Musa and the Prophet Sulayman, peace be upon them both, and even in the time before the noble Muhammadan Prophetic mission. This comes from the other world's feeling that it has come to own the earth and those upon it. This matter has no end except by reshaping the earth according to the heavenly standards in worship, food and conduct. The experience of Allah's prophet Musa, peace be upon him, and of Allah's prophet Sulayman, peace be upon him, in facing the tyranny of the sorcerers and their masters: these two experiences are returning, but in forms and measures that may resemble them and do not necessarily match.

In the first Islamic era the earth was also suffering from the same problem, because there was no light on the earth. The light came with our Prophet Muhammad ﷺ and his family, and the earth shone with the light of its Lord and His words (the Mighty Qur'an). The light of the Prophet ﷺ and his family was radiant among the creation of Allah the Exalted, extinguishing every negative satanic energy. So the earth at that time had indeed entered a new cycle of positivity that brought about man's security and the calm of his soul, after the devils had toyed with man for long centuries ..

And today the earth is living a cycle in which a band of devils holds sway over a band of the children of Adam whose number may be in the billions, because people's positive energy has dimmed and weakened in the cities and homes. Though there are righteous people on earth, their light does not have the power to send radiance into the veins of pitch-black gloom and darkness so that it scatters and the man of today finds rest from the severe exhaustion of soul that has struck him. On the other hand, the darkness spread over the earth and exhausting to mankind has come to make the followers of the other world believe that they have triumphed over mankind. Their darkness has become dominant and they have felt that they have triumphed. The followers of the other world and its leaders have come to think that they have dominated, taken control, succeeded and become established, and that the cycle of light will not return again as it returned in the era of the prophets of Allah the Exalted, Musa, Sulayman and Muhammad, blessings and peace be upon them.""")

h(50, 2250, """The earth today suffers from the sway of the other world, as in the time of Allah's prophet Musa, Allah's prophet Sulayman and our Prophet!""")
